# Generated CSS only

Do **not** edit CSS files directly. Every CSS variable and rule in this repo must come from the token build.

## Source of truth

- Edit token JSON under `tokens/` (and `scripts/build-tokens.mjs` only when changing how tokens compile to CSS).
- Regenerate output with `npm run build` (runs `scripts/build-tokens.mjs`).

## Do not edit

- `dist/**/*.css` — auto-generated; changes will be overwritten on the next build.
- Do not add hand-written `.css` files for design tokens or theme/component styles.

## When CSS needs to change

1. Update the relevant token set(s) in `tokens/`.
2. Run `npm run build`.
3. Commit the updated token sources; `dist/` may be committed if this repo ships built CSS, but it must always be produced by the build script, never patched by hand.
